# This repo is cloned and built on Linux. CRLF in a Dockerfile or a shell
# heredoc breaks in ways that look like a broken image rather than a line
# ending, so pin everything that the build touches to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
